r litre of FSSP fuel; and* >>> >>> *(v) the name of the person paid;* >> >> *(d) the total number of litres of each FSSP fuel for which a fuel security services payment was paid;* >> >> *(e) any other information required by the rules.* > > *(2) The Secretary must publish, on the Department's website, the Minister's statement under subsection (1).*","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-7282","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2021-06-22/14"}
